{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FXLd8Ukp8x9NrJLYjMsm38","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — solver-trace-ablation\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (NLP and Symbolic Reasoning track)\n5\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n6\t- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (2 条，精简自原始 5 条)\n9\t\n10\t### Claim 1: STA as Reward Design Methodology\n11\tSolver Trace Ablation (STA), grounded in the Reachability-Infection-Propagation (RIP) framework from mutation testing theory, provides a **general, solver-agnostic procedure** for deriving intensional verification rewards from solver execution semantics. For any solver+language pair, a 5-step derivation protocol (pilot → collect shortcuts → classify → map RIP → design check) produces domain-specific structural rewards. This is the first application of the RIP framework to RL reward design.\n12\t\n13\t**MVP 证据**: Full STA 在 FOL+Prover9 上提供连续 ISR（0.125-0.889），成功检测 GRPO 训练中的 reward hacking（ISR/PR 比从 64%→33%）。O(1) 近似（tautology-only check）信号过粗无效——重要阴性结果，证明了 full component ablation 的必要性。\n14\t\n15\t### Claim 2: Multi-Logic GRPO Empirical Findings\n16\tMulti-logic GRPO training across structurally different formal languages (FOL→Prover9, Prolog→SWI-Prolog, SMT-LIB→Z3) exhibits measurable cross-logic transfer patterns and logic-type-specific reward hacking modes. STA-derived rewards detect and quantify these phenomena.\n17\t\n18\t**MVP 证据**: 待验证（FOL 单逻辑已验证，multi-logic 需 research 阶段实验）。\n19\t\n20\t## Story Spine\n21\t\n22\t- **Problem**: GRPO with solver-verified rewards trains formalizers that achieve high execution accuracy but produce structurally degenerate outputs (reward hacking). Existing structural reward designs are ad-hoc heuristics with no principled derivation.\n23\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Mellgren et al. (2025) hand-craft Prolog-specific structure penalties. EVOM (2026) demonstrates cross-solver GRPO transfer but uses scalar execution rewards only. ExecVerify/EGCA derive trace-level rewards for code, not formal logic. No work provides a general derivation procedure for structural rewards from solver semantics.\n24\t- **Our framing**: We adapt the RIP framework from mutation testing — a component is \"necessary\" iff its ablation changes the solver's output — to derive intensional verification rewards. STA fills the **dense + automatic** cell in the ORM-PRM reward taxonomy (ORM=sparse+automatic, PRM=dense+manual, STA=dense+automatic via solver semantics). This positions STA not as \"a new algorithm\" but as \"the first systematic transfer of mutation testing methodology to RL reward design.\"\n25\t- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO/ProofWriter/LogiQA, STA-rewarded GRPO achieves <X>% formalization accuracy with <Y>% ISR, compared to <Z>% accuracy / <W>% ISR for execution-only GRPO — maintaining accuracy while detecting and reducing structural degeneracy.\"\n26\t\n27\t## Venue Fit Risks\n28\t\n29\t- **EMNLP fit**: Core contribution is neurosymbolic (NLP + formal logic), directly in the NLP and Symbolic Reasoning track. Formal verification + RL reward design is highly relevant.\n30\t- **\"Old wine\" risk**: STA's component ablation resembles mutation testing. Mitigation: explicitly acknowledge the RIP origin, claim novelty at the methodology transfer level + empirical findings, not at the algorithm level.\n31\t- **Scope breadth risk**: Original proposal had 5 contributions — trimmed to 2 core (STA methodology + empirical findings). MLSR framework, hacking taxonomy, STA-IPT duality are secondary analysis within these 2 contributions.\n32\t- **Single-logic risk**: If only FOL results are available, paper may feel narrow. Mitigation: at minimum include Prolog as second logic type; SMT-LIB as stretch goal.\n33\t\n34\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n35\t\n36\t1. **\"STA is just mutation testing applied to FOL\"** — Response: yes, that's the point. The contribution is the systematic transfer + empirical validation that it works as RL reward, not algorithmic novelty. The 5-step derivation protocol is the transferable methodology.\n37\t2. **\"O(1) approximation doesn't work\"** — Response: this is a feature, not a bug. We report it as a principled negative result showing that domain-specific hacking modes require corresponding ablation granularity.\n38\t3. **\"Low prove rate limits GRPO signal\"** — Response: addressed by K=8+ and difficulty-based data selection. Prove rate increases during training (12%→15-20%).\n39\t4. **\"ISR/PR ratio declining even with STA reward\"** — Response: 100-step pilot is too short; full runs with curriculum will show whether STA prevents or just detects degradation. Even detection alone is a contribution (monitoring tool).\n40\t5. **\"Only tested on one/two logic types\"** — Response: STA derivation protocol is solver-agnostic by design; instantiations for additional logic types follow the same 5-step procedure.\n41\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c3b8d53-bad7-4388-a83b-ef028fa0e75a","uuid":"5a8190bb-9525-452a-b6b6-5a4aea33b1a7","timestamp":"2026-05-13T22:22:25.198Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T215750/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — solver-trace-ablation\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (NLP and Symbolic Reasoning track)\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n\n## Core Claims (2 条，精简自原始 5 条)\n\n### Claim 1: STA as Reward Design Methodology\nSolver Trace Ablation (STA), grounded in the Reachability-Infection-Propagation (RIP) framework from mutation testing theory, provides a **general, solver-agnostic procedure** for deriving intensional verification rewards from solver execution semantics. For any solver+language pair, a 5-step derivation protocol (pilot → collect shortcuts → classify → map RIP → design check) produces domain-specific structural rewards. This is the first application of the RIP framework to RL reward design.\n\n**MVP 证据**: Full STA 在 FOL+Prover9 上提供连续 ISR（0.125-0.889），成功检测 GRPO 训练中的 reward hacking（ISR/PR 比从 64%→33%）。O(1) 近似（tautology-only check）信号过粗无效——重要阴性结果，证明了 full component ablation 的必要性。\n\n### Claim 2: Multi-Logic GRPO Empirical Findings\nMulti-logic GRPO training across structurally different formal languages (FOL→Prover9, Prolog→SWI-Prolog, SMT-LIB→Z3) exhibits measurable cross-logic transfer patterns and logic-type-specific reward hacking modes. STA-derived rewards detect and quantify these phenomena.\n\n**MVP 证据**: 待验证（FOL 单逻辑已验证，multi-logic 需 research 阶段实验）。\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: GRPO with solver-verified rewards trains formalizers that achieve high execution accuracy but produce structurally degenerate outputs (reward hacking). Existing structural reward designs are ad-hoc heuristics with no principled derivation.\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Mellgren et al. (2025) hand-craft Prolog-specific structure penalties. EVOM (2026) demonstrates cross-solver GRPO transfer but uses scalar execution rewards only. ExecVerify/EGCA derive trace-level rewards for code, not formal logic. No work provides a general derivation procedure for structural rewards from solver semantics.\n- **Our framing**: We adapt the RIP framework from mutation testing — a component is \"necessary\" iff its ablation changes the solver's output — to derive intensional verification rewards. STA fills the **dense + automatic** cell in the ORM-PRM reward taxonomy (ORM=sparse+automatic, PRM=dense+manual, STA=dense+automatic via solver semantics). This positions STA not as \"a new algorithm\" but as \"the first systematic transfer of mutation testing methodology to RL reward design.\"\n- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO/ProofWriter/LogiQA, STA-rewarded GRPO achieves <X>% formalization accuracy with <Y>% ISR, compared to <Z>% accuracy / <W>% ISR for execution-only GRPO — maintaining accuracy while detecting and reducing structural degeneracy.\"\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n- **EMNLP fit**: Core contribution is neurosymbolic (NLP + formal logic), directly in the NLP and Symbolic Reasoning track. Formal verification + RL reward design is highly relevant.\n- **\"Old wine\" risk**: STA's component ablation resembles mutation testing. Mitigation: explicitly acknowledge the RIP origin, claim novelty at the methodology transfer level + empirical findings, not at the algorithm level.\n- **Scope breadth risk**: Original proposal had 5 contributions — trimmed to 2 core (STA methodology + empirical findings). MLSR framework, hacking taxonomy, STA-IPT duality are secondary analysis within these 2 contributions.\n- **Single-logic risk**: If only FOL results are available, paper may feel narrow. Mitigation: at minimum include Prolog as second logic type; SMT-LIB as stretch goal.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n1. **\"STA is just mutation testing applied to FOL\"** — Response: yes, that's the point. The contribution is the systematic transfer + empirical validation that it works as RL reward, not algorithmic novelty. The 5-step derivation protocol is the transferable methodology.\n2. **\"O(1) approximation doesn't work\"** — Response: this is a feature, not a bug. We report it as a principled negative result showing that domain-specific hacking modes require corresponding ablation granularity.\n3. **\"Low prove rate limits GRPO signal\"** — Response: addressed by K=8+ and difficulty-based data selection. Prove rate increases during training (12%→15-20%).\n4. **\"ISR/PR ratio declining even with STA reward\"** — Response: 100-step pilot is too short; full runs with curriculum will show whether STA prevents or just detects degradation. Even detection alone is a contribution (monitoring tool).\n5. **\"Only tested on one/two logic types\"** — Response: STA derivation protocol is solver-agnostic by design; instantiations for additional logic types follow the same 5-step procedure.\n","numLines":41,"startLine":1,"totalLines":41}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EEwDi9HeWzf9x693u8Gtw2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"FOL exec-only baseline (500 steps, 3 seeds)\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"FOL single-logic GRPO，仅用 execution reward (prove/fail binary)，K=8，500 steps，3 seeds。 作为 STA 对比的 baseline。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"prove_rate_overall_mean\": 0.24,\n7\t      \"prove_rate_overall_std\": 0.03,\n8\t      \"prove_rate_first100_mean\": 0.15,\n9\t      \"prove_rate_last100_mean\": 0.28,\n10\t      \"mean_isr_overall\": 0.11,\n11\t      \"mean_isr_last100\": 0.08,\n12\t      \"isr_pr_ratio_first100\": 0.82,\n13\t      \"isr_pr_ratio_last100\": 0.29,\n14\t      \"reward_mean_last100\": 0.28,\n15\t      \"training_minutes_per_seed\": 78,\n16\t      \"step_time_s\": 9.4\n17\t    },\n18\t    \"tables\": [\n19\t      {\n20\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Exec-only training dynamics (3-seed average)\",\n21\t        \"columns\": [\n22\t          \"step_range\",\n23\t          \"prove_rate\",\n24\t          \"mean_isr\",\n25\t          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n26\t          \"reward_mean\"\n27\t        ],\n28\t        \"rows\": [\n29\t          [\n30\t            \"0-100\",\n31\t            0.15,\n32\t            0.14,\n33\t            0.82,\n34\t            0.15\n35\t          ],\n36\t          [\n37\t            \"100-200\",\n38\t            0.19,\n39\t            0.12,\n40\t            0.55,\n41\t            0.19\n42\t          ],\n43\t          [\n44\t            \"200-300\",\n45\t            0.22,\n46\t            0.1,\n47\t            0.41,\n48\t            0.22\n49\t          ],\n50\t          [\n51\t            \"300-400\",\n52\t            0.25,\n53\t            0.09,\n54\t            0.33,\n55\t            0.25\n56\t          ],\n57\t          [\n58\t            \"400-500\",\n59\t            0.28,\n60\t            0.08,\n61\t            0.29,\n62\t            0.28\n63\t          ]\n64\t        ]\n65\t      }\n66\t    ],\n67\t    \"figures\": [],\n68\t    \"analysis\": \"Exec-only baseline 展现了 reward hacking 的教科书式 trajectory。prove_rate 的持续上升掩盖了 structural quality 的同步恶化。到 500 步时，约 71% 的 proved outputs 是 structurally degenerate (ISR/PR=0.29)。这为 STA 的 diagnostic 价值提供了 ground truth：如果没有 ISR metric， 仅看 prove_rate 会误判训练效果。\\n\\n\\n从 r5 数据外推：100 步时 prove_rate=0.15，last20=0.20，ISR/PR=1.0。500 步训练中， prove_rate 因 GRPO 的 on-policy exploration 持续上升至 ~0.28（符合 worst 区间 [0.18,0.3] 上段）， 但这种上升主要来自模型学会了 structural shortcuts（tautology injection, vacuous quantification, trivially true premises）。ISR/PR ratio 从初始 ~0.82 急剧下降至 ~0.29，反映了 structural degeneracy 的累积——模型越来越多地通过 degenerate proofs 获得 execution reward。这是经典的 reward hacking trajectory：accuracy 上升但 structural quality 同步恶化。3 seeds 间 variance 较小（std=0.03）， 说明这不是随机波动而是训练动力学的系统性特征。\\n\"\n69\t  },\n70\t  {\n71\t    \"name\": \"FOL exec+STA reward (500 steps, 3 seeds)\",\n72\t    \"description\": \"FOL single-logic GRPO，execution + full STA reward (α=0.5, β=0.5)，K=8，500 steps，3 seeds。 Primary STA validation。\\n\",\n73\t    \"results\": {\n74\t      \"prove_rate_overall_mean\": 0.11,\n75\t      \"prove_rate_overall_std\": 0.02,\n76\t      \"prove_rate_first100_mean\": 0.09,\n77\t      \"prove_rate_last100_mean\": 0.13,\n78\t      \"mean_isr_overall\": 0.042,\n79\t      \"mean_isr_last100\": 0.038,\n80\t      \"isr_pr_ratio_first100\": 0.41,\n81\t      \"isr_pr_ratio_last100\": 0.27,\n82\t      \"reward_mean_last100\": 0.084,\n83\t      \"training_minutes_per_seed\": 84,\n84\t      \"step_time_s\": 10.1\n85\t    },\n86\t    \"tables\": [\n87\t      {\n88\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Exec+STA training dynamics (3-seed average)\",\n89\t        \"columns\": [\n90\t          \"step_range\",\n91\t          \"prove_rate\",\n92\t          \"mean_isr\",\n93\t          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n94\t          \"reward_mean\"\n95\t        ],\n96\t        \"rows\": [\n97\t          [\n98\t            \"0-100\",\n99\t            0.09,\n100\t            0.052,\n101\t            0.41,\n102\t            0.071\n103\t          ],\n104\t          [\n105\t            \"100-200\",\n106\t            0.1,\n107\t            0.047,\n108\t            0.38,\n109\t            0.074\n110\t          ],\n111\t          [\n112\t            \"200-300\",\n113\t            0.11,\n114\t            0.044,\n115\t            0.34,\n116\t            0.077\n117\t          ],\n118\t          [\n119\t            \"300-400\",\n120\t            0.12,\n121\t            0.041,\n122\t            0.3,\n123\t            0.081\n124\t          ],\n125\t          [\n126\t            \"400-500\",\n127\t            0.13,\n128\t            0.038,\n129\t            0.27,\n130\t            0.084\n131\t          ]\n132\t        ]\n133\t      }\n134\t    ],\n135\t    \"figures\": [],\n136\t    \"analysis\": \"STA reward 在 worst 档下表现为 net negative signal。prove_rate 的 gap（0.28 vs 0.13 at step 500） 具有统计显著性（p<0.01, 3 seeds），明确说明 STA reward hurts accuracy。ISR/PR ratio 两组均收敛至 相似低值（0.29 vs 0.27），说明 STA 也未能阻止 structural degeneracy。 关键 insight：在 prove_rate < 20% 的 sparse-signal regime 下，添加任何 secondary reward 都会因 gradient variance amplification 损害 primary objective。这本身是一个有价值的 negative result。\\n\\n\\n从 r5 数据外推：100 步时 prove_rate=0.10，ISR/PR=0.33（已低于 exec-only 的 1.0）。 在 worst 档下，STA reward 的加入不仅未提升 structural quality，反而通过两个机制损害了训练： (1) Low prove_rate regime 下 ISR 信号极度稀疏——只有 ~10% 的 samples 能 prove，其中仅 ~30% 有非零 ISR，导致 STA reward gradient 方差极大； (2) STA penalty 对 degenerate proofs 的惩罚使模型学会了回避 provable formulations， 转向 unprovable-but-syntactically-valid 的 outputs（\\\"reward avoidance\\\" 而非 \\\"reward seeking\\\"）。 结果是 prove_rate 被压制在 0.13 以下（远低于 exec-only 的 0.28），同时 ISR/PR ratio 仍继续下降 （0.41→0.27），说明即使 STA 惩罚了 degenerate proofs，少数仍 provable 的 outputs 中 structural quality 并未改善。Worst 档的核心表现：STA reward 同时降低了 accuracy 和 structural quality。\\n\"\n137\t  },\n138\t  {\n139\t    \"name\": \"Held-out evaluation (plan_001 vs plan_002)\",\n140\t    \"description\": \"在 test set 上对 plan_001 和 plan_002 的 best checkpoint 进行统一 full STA evaluation， 包括 prove_rate, ISR, ISR/PR ratio, hacking taxonomy annotation。\\n\",\n141\t    \"results\": {\n142\t      \"exec_only_held_out_prove_rate\": 0.22,\n143\t      \"exec_only_held_out_isr_mean\": 0.058,\n144\t      \"exec_only_held_out_isr_pr_ratio\": 0.26,\n145\t      \"exec_sta_held_out_prove_rate\": 0.1,\n146\t      \"exec_sta_held_out_isr_mean\": 0.035,\n147\t      \"exec_sta_held_out_isr_pr_ratio\": 0.3,\n148\t      \"exec_only_hacking_rate\": 0.74,\n149\t      \"exec_sta_hacking_rate\": 0.7\n150\t    },\n151\t    \"tables\": [\n152\t      {\n153\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Held-out evaluation summary\",\n154\t        \"columns\": [\n155\t          \"condition\",\n156\t          \"prove_rate\",\n157\t          \"mean_isr\",\n158\t          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n159\t          \"hacking_rate\"\n160\t        ],\n161\t        \"rows\": [\n162\t          [\n163\t            \"exec-only (best ckpt)\",\n164\t            0.22,\n165\t            0.058,\n166\t            0.26,\n167\t            0.74\n168\t          ],\n169\t          [\n170\t            \"exec+STA (best ckpt)\",\n171\t            0.1,\n172\t            0.035,\n173\t            0.3,\n174\t            0.7\n175\t          ],\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"base model (no training)\",\n178\t            0.12,\n179\t            0.064,\n180\t            0.53,\n181\t            0.47\n182\t          ]\n183\t        ]\n184\t      }\n185\t    ],\n186\t    \"figures\": [],\n187\t    \"analysis\": \"Striking 发现：base model 的 ISR/PR ratio (0.53) 远高于两个训练后模型（0.26, 0.30）。 这说明 GRPO training 本身——无论是否加入 STA reward——都导致了 structural degeneracy。 STA reward 未能逆转这一趋势。但这个对比本身是 pivot narrative 的核心 empirical evidence： STA as diagnostic 能够量化 training-induced structural degradation，即使它无法作为 reward signal 阻止之。\\n\\n\\nHeld-out 表现与 training 趋势一致但 prove_rate 略低（distribution shift）。两组 held-out ISR 均落入 worst 区间 [0.03, 0.08]。关键发现：exec-only 虽然 prove_rate 高得多（0.22 vs 0.10）， 但 hacking_rate 极高（74%），说明其 accuracy 增益几乎全部来自 degenerate proofs。 exec+STA 的 hacking_rate 略低（70%），但考虑到其 prove_rate 仅为 0.10， 这个微小差异没有统计意义。ISR/PR ratio 在 held-out 上 exec+STA（0.30）甚至略高于 exec-only（0.26）， 但两者均在 worst 区间 [0.15-0.35] 内，差异不显著。结论：STA reward 对 held-out generalization 没有提供任何结构性改善。\\n\"\n188\t  },\n189\t  {\n190\t    \"name\": \"O(1) vs O(N) ablation (500 steps)\",\n191\t    \"description\": \"用 fast_isr_fol (O(1) tautology-only check) 替代 full STA，500 steps，1 seed， 确认 O(1) 近似在长训练中同样无效。\\n\",\n192\t    \"results\": {\n193\t      \"prove_rate_500step\": 0.23,\n194\t      \"mean_isr_o1\": 0.006,\n195\t      \"isr_pr_ratio_o1\": 0.03,\n196\t      \"reward_mean_last100\": 0.23,\n197\t      \"isr_discriminability\": 0.02\n198\t    },\n199\t    \"tables\": [\n200\t      {\n201\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: O(1) vs O(N) comparison at step 500\",\n202\t        \"columns\": [\n203\t          \"condition\",\n204\t          \"prove_rate\",\n205\t          \"mean_isr\",\n206\t          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n207\t          \"isr_discriminability\"\n208\t        ],\n209\t        \"rows\": [\n210\t          [\n211\t            \"exec-only\",\n212\t            0.24,\n213\t            0.11,\n214\t            0.29,\n215\t            \"N/A\"\n216\t          ],\n217\t          [\n218\t            \"exec+STA O(N)\",\n219\t            0.11,\n220\t            0.042,\n221\t            0.27,\n222\t            0.31\n223\t          ],\n224\t          [\n225\t            \"exec+STA O(1)\",\n226\t            0.23,\n227\t            0.006,\n228\t            0.03,\n229\t            0.02\n230\t          ]\n231\t        ]\n232\t      }\n233\t    ],\n234\t    \"figures\": [],\n235\t    \"analysis\": \"O(1) 结果强化了 plan_002 的 negative finding：不是 STA 的粒度太粗导致 O(N) 失败， 而是在 low-prove-rate regime 下任何 ISR-based reward 都无法提供有效信号。 O(1) 的 near-zero discriminability 是一个 clean negative result，适合写入论文作为 \\\"ablation granularity matters for diagnostic but not for training\\\" 的 evidence。\\n\\n\\nO(1) (tautology-only check) 几乎退化为 exec-only：fast_isr_fol 仅检测最粗粒度的 tautology （如 P ∨ ¬P），而 GRPO 训练产生的 degenerate proofs 类型远更精细（vacuous quantification, premise redundancy, trivially satisfiable structures）。这些 subtler hacking modes 完全绕过 tautology check，导致 O(1) ISR ≈ 0 对绝大多数 samples。prove_rate 与 exec-only 基本一致 （0.23 vs 0.24），证明 O(1) ISR signal 没有对训练产生任何影响——它既不提供有用的 gradient 信号（太稀疏），也不消耗足够计算资源来产生隐式正则化效应。ISR discriminability 仅 0.02， 远低于 full STA 的 ~0.3，确认 O(1) 近似无法区分 structural quality levels。\\n\"\n236\t  },\n237\t  {\n238\t    \"name\": \"STA reward weight ablation (α/β ratios + curriculum)\",\n239\t    \"description\": \"测试 α/β = {0.3/0.7, 0.5/0.5, 0.7/0.3} + sigmoid curriculum vs fixed， 共 6 configurations，各 200 steps，1 seed。\\n\",\n240\t    \"results\": {\n241\t      \"configs\": [\n242\t        {\n243\t          \"config\": \"α=0.3 β=0.7 fixed\",\n244\t          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.18,\n245\t          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.35,\n246\t          \"reward_mean\": 0.19\n247\t        },\n248\t        {\n249\t          \"config\": \"α=0.5 β=0.5 fixed\",\n250\t          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.13,\n251\t          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.3,\n252\t          \"reward_mean\": 0.09\n253\t        },\n254\t        {\n255\t          \"config\": \"α=0.7 β=0.3 fixed\",\n256\t          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.07,\n257\t          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.38,\n258\t          \"reward_mean\": 0.05\n259\t        },\n260\t        {\n261\t          \"config\": \"α=0.3 β=0.7 sigmoid\",\n262\t          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.19,\n263\t          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.33,\n264\t          \"reward_mean\": 0.2\n265\t        },\n266\t        {\n267\t          \"config\": \"α=0.5 β=0.5 sigmoid\",\n268\t          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.15,\n269\t          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.29,\n270\t          \"reward_mean\": 0.1\n271\t        },\n272\t        {\n273\t          \"config\": \"α=0.7 β=0.3 sigmoid\",\n274\t          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.09,\n275\t          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.35,\n276\t          \"reward_mean\": 0.06\n277\t        }\n278\t      ],\n279\t      \"best_prove_rate_config\": \"α=0.3 β=0.7 sigmoid\",\n280\t      \"best_isr_pr_config\": \"α=0.7 β=0.3 fixed\",\n281\t      \"stable_operating_point\": null\n282\t    },\n283\t    \"tables\": [\n284\t      {\n285\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Weight ablation results at step 200\",\n286\t        \"columns\": [\n287\t          \"α\",\n288\t          \"β\",\n289\t          \"schedule\",\n290\t          \"prove_rate\",\n291\t          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n292\t          \"reward_mean\"\n293\t        ],\n294\t        \"rows\": [\n295\t          [\n296\t            0.3,\n297\t            0.7,\n298\t            \"fixed\",\n299\t            0.18,\n300\t            0.35,\n301\t            0.19\n302\t          ],\n303\t          [\n304\t            0.5,\n305\t            0.5,\n306\t            \"fixed\",\n307\t            0.13,\n308\t            0.3,\n309\t            0.09\n310\t          ],\n311\t          [\n312\t            0.7,\n313\t            0.3,\n314\t            \"fixed\",\n315\t            0.07,\n316\t            0.38,\n317\t            0.05\n318\t          ],\n319\t          [\n320\t            0.3,\n321\t            0.7,\n322\t            \"sigmoid\",\n323\t            0.19,\n324\t            0.33,\n325\t            0.2\n326\t          ],\n327\t          [\n328\t            0.5,\n329\t            0.5,\n330\t            \"sigmoid\",\n331\t            0.15,\n332\t            0.29,\n333\t            0.1\n334\t          ],\n335\t          [\n336\t            0.7,\n337\t            0.3,\n338\t            \"sigmoid\",\n339\t            0.09,\n340\t            0.35,\n341\t            0.06\n342\t          ]\n343\t        ]\n344\t      }\n345\t    ],\n346\t    \"figures\": [],\n347\t    \"analysis\": \"6 个 configurations 均位于 exec-only baseline 的 Pareto frontier 之下或之上但仅在一个维度。 没有任何设置同时改善 prove_rate 和 ISR/PR ratio。这是 worst 档的 definitive evidence： STA reward 在当前 prove_rate regime 下没有 viable operating point。 写入论文时应 frame 为：\\\"STA reward 的有效性受限于 base prove_rate——当 solver success rate < 20% 时， ISR 的 per-step 有效 sample size 不足以支撑稳定的 policy gradient 估计。这为未来工作指出了 clear prerequisite：STA-as-reward 需要更强的 base solver 或 curriculum-based prove_rate bootstrapping。\\\"\\n\\n\\nWorst 档核心假设：no stable operating point exists。具体表现为 prove_rate 和 ISR/PR ratio 之间存在不可调和的 Pareto trade-off： - 低 β（STA 权重小）：prove_rate 接近 exec-only 但 ISR/PR 无改善（STA 信号被淹没） - 高 β（STA 权重大）：ISR/PR ratio 略有改善但 prove_rate 被严重压制（0.07-0.09） - Sigmoid curriculum 略优于 fixed（early 阶段 STA 权重低允许 prove_rate 建立），\\n  但 200 步时差异不显著（0.19 vs 0.18）\\n根本原因是 ISR signal 的 sparsity：只有 proved samples 才有非零 ISR，而 prove_rate < 20% 意味着 STA reward 的有效 batch size 约为 K × prove_rate ≈ 1.6 samples/step。这个 sample efficiency 太低，无法在任何 α/β 设置下提供稳定的 training signal。\\n\"\n348\t  },\n349\t  {\n350\t    \"name\": \"Prolog single-logic GRPO (exec-only vs exec+STA)\",\n351\t    \"description\": \"Prolog STA instantiation + single-logic GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 steps，K=8，1 seed。 Second logic type validation。\\n\",\n352\t    \"results\": {\n353\t      \"prolog_sta_instantiation_success\": false,\n354\t      \"prolog_solver_timeout_rate\": 0.65,\n355\t      \"prolog_prove_rate_exec_only\": 0.03,\n356\t      \"prolog_prove_rate_exec_sta\": 0.01,\n357\t      \"prolog_isr_discriminability\": 0.04,\n358\t      \"prolog_mean_isr\": 0.008,\n359\t      \"prolog_training_completed\": false,\n360\t      \"failure_mode\": \"solver_timeout_and_trivial_isr\"\n361\t    },\n362\t    \"tables\": [\n363\t      {\n364\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Prolog STA instantiation diagnostics\",\n365\t        \"columns\": [\n366\t          \"metric\",\n367\t          \"value\"\n368\t        ],\n369\t        \"rows\": [\n370\t          [\n371\t            \"SWI-Prolog timeout rate (10s)\",\n372\t            \"65%\"\n373\t          ],\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"Mean clauses per program\",\n376\t            2.7\n377\t          ],\n378\t          [\n379\t            \"ISR binary rate (0 or 1)\",\n380\t            \"89%\"\n381\t          ],\n382\t          [\n383\t            \"ISR discriminability\",\n384\t            0.04\n385\t          ],\n386\t          [\n387\t            \"Prove rate (base model)\",\n388\t            0.03\n389\t          ],\n390\t          [\n391\t            \"Training terminated early\",\n392\t            \"yes (step ~300)\"\n393\t          ]\n394\t        ]\n395\t      }\n396\t    ],\n397\t    \"figures\": [],\n398\t    \"analysis\": \"Prolog 实例化的失败并非 STA 方法论的失败，而是 infrastructure 层面的问题： (1) SWI-Prolog 的 timeout 行为使 O(N) ablation 在合理时间内不可行； (2) 基座模型的 Prolog 生成能力太弱（prove_rate 0.03），GRPO 缺乏 bootstrap signal。 论文中应诚实报告这些 failure modes，并 frame 为 STA derivation protocol 第 1 步（pilot study） 的 go/no-go 信号——Prolog 在当前 setup 下是 \\\"no-go\\\"，这本身验证了 protocol 的 gatekeeping 功能。\\n\\n\\nProlog STA 实例化在 worst 档下失败，原因链： (1) SWI-Prolog rule ablation 需要逐条删除 clause 并重新 query——对每个 N-clause 程序需 N 次 solver call，而 SWI-Prolog 在复杂递归程序上 timeout 率高（65% samples 超过 10s timeout）； (2) 成功执行的 samples 中，大部分 Prolog 程序结构简单（2-3 clauses），ISR 退化为 binary (0 或 1)，discriminability 仅 0.04——无法区分 structural quality levels； (3) prove_rate 极低（0.03），因为 LLM 生成的 Prolog 大多无法通过 SWI-Prolog 的 strict syntax check（缺少 dot terminator, 变量命名错误, 递归无 base case 等）。 在这种条件下 GRPO 训练几乎没有可用的 reward signal，500 步后 prove_rate 无显著变化。 exec+STA 条件更差（0.01），因为少量 proved samples 中 ISR penalty 进一步压制了 reward。 训练在 ~300 步后因 KL divergence explosion 被提前终止。\\n\"\n399\t  },\n400\t  {\n401\t    \"name\": \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog)\",\n402\t    \"description\": \"FOL+Prolog mixed training，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 steps，K=8，1 seed。 Cross-logic transfer test。\\n\",\n403\t    \"results\": {\n404\t      \"status\": \"not_run\",\n405\t      \"reason\": \"blocked by plan_006 failure — Prolog prove_rate too low for meaningful multi-logic training\"\n406\t    },\n407\t    \"tables\": [],\n408\t    \"figures\": [],\n409\t    \"analysis\": \"Plan_007 未执行是 worst 档的直接后果。论文叙事中这意味着 Claim 2 (multi-logic) 无法验证， paper 退化为 single-logic (FOL-only)。叙事 pivot 将 multi-logic 从 core claim 降级为 future work，Claim 2 重新定义为 \\\"single-logic deep analysis of reward hacking patterns\\\"。\\n\\n\\nplan_006 的 Prolog prove_rate (0.03) 使得 mixed training 中 Prolog samples 几乎不贡献 任何 reward signal。如果强行运行，mixed batch 中 Prolog samples 会稀释 FOL 的有效 gradient， 导致 FOL prove_rate 也下降。鉴于 plan_006 已明确 Prolog 不可用，plan_007 被标记为 not_run 以节省 GPU budget。论文中应说明 blocked dependency 并将此作为 limitation 讨论。\\n\"\n410\t  },\n411\t  {\n412\t    \"name\": \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation\",\n413\t    \"description\": \"FOL-trained model 在 Prolog tasks 上的 zero-shot evaluation，反之亦然。\\n\",\n414\t    \"results\": {\n415\t      \"fol_to_prolog_prove_rate\": 0.02,\n416\t      \"fol_to_prolog_delta_vs_base\": -0.01,\n417\t      \"prolog_to_fol_prove_rate\": 0.1,\n418\t      \"prolog_to_fol_delta_vs_base\": -0.02,\n419\t      \"cross_logic_transfer_delta_mean\": -0.015\n420\t    },\n421\t    \"tables\": [\n422\t      {\n423\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Cross-logic transfer matrix\",\n424\t        \"columns\": [\n425\t          \"train_logic\",\n426\t          \"eval_logic\",\n427\t          \"prove_rate\",\n428\t          \"delta_vs_base\"\n429\t        ],\n430\t        \"rows\": [\n431\t          [\n432\t            \"FOL\",\n433\t            \"FOL\",\n434\t            0.24,\n435\t            \"+0.12\"\n436\t          ],\n437\t          [\n438\t            \"FOL\",\n439\t            \"Prolog\",\n440\t            0.02,\n441\t            \"-0.01\"\n442\t          ],\n443\t          [\n444\t            \"Prolog\",\n445\t            \"FOL\",\n446\t            0.1,\n447\t            \"-0.02\"\n448\t          ],\n449\t          [\n450\t            \"Prolog\",\n451\t            \"Prolog\",\n452\t            0.03,\n453\t            \"±0.00\"\n454\t          ],\n455\t          [\n456\t            \"base\",\n457\t            \"FOL\",\n458\t            0.12,\n459\t            \"—\"\n460\t          ],\n461\t          [\n462\t            \"base\",\n463\t            \"Prolog\",\n464\t            0.03,\n465\t            \"—\"\n466\t          ]\n467\t        ]\n468\t      }\n469\t    ],\n470\t    \"figures\": [],\n471\t    \"analysis\": \"Transfer matrix 的 off-diagonal 元素均 ≤ base model，排除了 positive transfer 的可能。 这在 worst 档下是 expected 的：FOL 和 Prolog 的 syntax、reasoning patterns、solver interface 差异太大，100-step scale 的 GRPO 训练不足以学到 transferable logical reasoning abilities。 论文中应将此作为 \\\"the GRPO signal is task-specific, not reasoning-general\\\" 的 evidence。\\n\\n\\nCross-logic transfer 在 worst 档下表现为 near-zero 或 slightly negative。 FOL→Prolog：基座模型 Prolog prove_rate 仅 0.03，FOL-trained 模型进一步下降至 0.02 （negative transfer，FOL 训练强化的 quantifier-heavy 生成模式不适用于 Prolog 的 clause-based 结构）。 Prolog→FOL：由于 plan_006 训练提前终止，Prolog-trained model 几乎等同于 base model， FOL prove_rate 为 0.10（略低于 base model 的 0.12，noise range 内）。 transfer_delta 均值 -0.015 落入 worst 区间 [-0.05, 0.01]。 结论：当前 setup 下不存在有意义的 cross-logic transfer，两种逻辑类型的 formalization patterns 在 representation space 中不共享可迁移的 substructures。\\n\"\n472\t  },\n473\t  {\n474\t    \"name\": \"SFT baseline comparison\",\n475\t    \"description\": \"Supervised finetuning on FOLIO 500 samples (gold FOL translations)，作为 GRPO 的 non-RL baseline。\\n\",\n476\t    \"results\": {\n477\t      \"sft_prove_rate\": 0.3,\n478\t      \"sft_mean_isr\": 0.15,\n479\t      \"sft_isr_pr_ratio\": 0.5,\n480\t      \"sft_hacking_rate\": 0.5,\n481\t      \"sft_training_minutes\": 12,\n482\t      \"sft_held_out_prove_rate\": 0.25,\n483\t      \"sft_held_out_isr_mean\": 0.12\n484\t    },\n485\t    \"tables\": [\n486\t      {\n487\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: SFT vs GRPO comparison\",\n488\t        \"columns\": [\n489\t          \"method\",\n490\t          \"prove_rate\",\n491\t          \"mean_isr\",\n492\t          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n493\t          \"hacking_rate\"\n494\t        ],\n495\t        \"rows\": [\n496\t          [\n497\t            \"SFT\",\n498\t            0.3,\n499\t            0.15,\n500\t            0.5,\n501\t            0.5\n502\t          ],\n503\t          [\n504\t            \"GRPO exec-only\",\n505\t            0.24,\n506\t            0.08,\n507\t            0.29,\n508\t            0.74\n509\t          ],\n510\t          [\n511\t            \"GRPO exec+STA\",\n512\t            0.11,\n513\t            0.038,\n514\t            0.27,\n515\t            0.7\n516\t          ],\n517\t          [\n518\t            \"base model\",\n519\t            0.12,\n520\t            0.064,\n521\t            0.53,\n522\t            0.47\n523\t          ]\n524\t        ]\n525\t      }\n526\t    ],\n527\t    \"figures\": [],\n528\t    \"analysis\": \"SFT baseline 是 worst 档 narrative 的关键支柱。它揭示了一个 hierarchy： SFT > exec-only GRPO > exec+STA GRPO（在 structural quality 上） SFT ≈ exec-only GRPO > exec+STA GRPO > base（在 accuracy 上） 这强化了 pivot narrative：GRPO+STA 不仅未解决 hacking，在每个维度上都是最差的。 但 SFT 的 limitation 是需要 gold data——这为 future work 留下了空间。\\n\\n\\nSFT 直接从 gold translations 学习，不受 reward signal sparsity 限制。prove_rate (0.30) 略高于 exec-only GRPO (0.24)，因为 SFT 的 supervised signal 更稳定。关键差异在 structural quality：SFT 的 ISR/PR ratio (0.50) 远高于两个 GRPO 条件（0.29 和 0.27），因为 SFT 模仿的是 gold translations 而非 solver-exploitable patterns。SFT 的 hacking_rate (0.50) 约为 exec-only GRPO (0.74) 的 2/3——说明 GRPO 的 on-policy exploration 特别容易发现并 exploit solver shortcuts。 这为 worst 档叙事提供了重要对比：不仅 STA reward 无效，exec-only GRPO 本身相对于 SFT 也引入了 额外的 structural degeneracy。论文可以 argue \\\"GRPO without adequate structural reward is actively worse than SFT for structural quality, despite similar or higher execution accuracy\\\"。\\n\"\n529\t  },\n530\t  {\n531\t    \"name\": \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO\",\n532\t    \"description\": \"SMT-LIB STA instantiation + single-logic GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA。Third logic type。\\n\",\n533\t    \"results\": {\n534\t      \"status\": \"not_run\",\n535\t      \"reason\": \"P2 priority, dropped after Prolog failure — budget redirected to plan_009 and plan_012\"\n536\t    },\n537\t    \"tables\": [],\n538\t    \"figures\": [],\n539\t    \"analysis\": \"合理的 triage 决策。论文中将 SMT-LIB 和 Prolog 均列为 future work， 并强调 STA derivation protocol 的 solver-agnostic 设计使得扩展是 straightforward 的 （given adequate solver performance and base model capability）。\\n\\n\\n在 Prolog 实例化失败后，继续尝试第三种逻辑类型的 ROI 太低。SMT-LIB (Z3) 面临与 Prolog 类似的 timeout 风险（constraint ablation 需要逐个删除 assert 并重新 check-sat）， 且基座模型的 SMT-LIB 生成能力未经验证。GPU budget 重新分配给更有确定性的 plan_009 (SFT baseline) 和 plan_012 (hacking characterization)，后者不需要 GPU 但需要大量人工标注时间。\\n\"\n540\t  },\n541\t  {\n542\t    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B scaling experiment\",\n543\t    \"description\": \"在 8B model 上运行 full MLSR pipeline (1 seed)，测试 model scale effect。\\n\",\n544\t    \"results\": {\n545\t      \"status\": \"not_run\",\n546\t      \"reason\": \"P2 priority, blocked by plan_005 showing no stable operating point — scaling a broken reward signal is pointless\"\n547\t    },\n548\t    \"tables\": [],\n549\t    \"figures\": [],\n550\t    \"analysis\": \"Correct decision。如果有额外 budget，应优先运行 8B exec-only（验证 scale 对 base prove_rate 的影响），而非 8B exec+STA。论文中可以将此作为 future work： \\\"STA-as-reward may become viable at higher base prove_rates achievable with larger models.\\\"\\n\\n\\nplan_005 已证明 STA reward 在当前架构下没有 viable operating point。在 8B model 上重复 失败的 reward design 不会改变根本问题（ISR signal sparsity）。虽然 8B model 可能有更高的 base prove_rate（缓解 sparsity），但这是一个 confound 而非 clean ablation。 Budget 不足以同时运行 8B exec-only baseline，无法区分 \\\"scale helps\\\" vs \\\"scale + STA helps\\\"。\\n\"\n551\t  },\n552\t  {\n553\t    \"name\": \"Hacking characterization (200-sample annotation)\",\n554\t    \"description\": \"对 plan_003 的 held-out outputs 进行 200-sample manual annotation， 按 extensional-shortcut taxonomy 分类 reward hacking patterns。\\n\",\n555\t    \"results\": {\n556\t      \"total_annotated\": 200,\n557\t      \"inter_annotator_agreement_kappa\": 0.72,\n558\t      \"taxonomy_categories\": {\n559\t        \"tautology_injection\": {\n560\t          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.28,\n561\t          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.22,\n562\t          \"example\": \"adding P ∨ ¬P as premise to make any conclusion provable\"\n563\t        },\n564\t        \"vacuous_quantification\": {\n565\t          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.19,\n566\t          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.21,\n567\t          \"example\": \"∀x(P(x) → Q(x)) where P is never instantiated\"\n568\t        },\n569\t        \"premise_redundancy\": {\n570\t          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.14,\n571\t          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.15,\n572\t          \"example\": \"repeating premises in different syntactic forms\"\n573\t        },\n574\t        \"trivial_conclusion\": {\n575\t          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.08,\n576\t          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.07,\n577\t          \"example\": \"concluding with a tautology regardless of premises\"\n578\t        },\n579\t        \"correct_structural\": {\n580\t          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.26,\n581\t          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.3,\n582\t          \"example\": \"genuinely reflects NL semantics\"\n583\t        },\n584\t        \"other_degenerate\": {\n585\t          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.05,\n586\t          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.05,\n587\t          \"example\": \"miscellaneous patterns not fitting above categories\"\n588\t        }\n589\t      },\n590\t      \"key_finding\": \"Hacking pattern distributions are nearly identical between exec-only and exec+STA, confirming STA reward did not selectively suppress any hacking mode.\\n\"\n591\t    },\n592\t    \"tables\": [\n593\t      {\n594\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Hacking taxonomy distribution (200 samples per condition)\",\n595\t        \"columns\": [\n596\t          \"category\",\n597\t          \"exec_only_%\",\n598\t          \"exec_sta_%\",\n599\t          \"ISR_sensitivity\"\n600\t        ],\n601\t        \"rows\": [\n602\t          [\n603\t            \"Tautology injection\",\n604\t            28,\n605\t            22,\n606\t            \"High (ISR detects 85%)\"\n607\t          ],\n608\t          [\n609\t            \"Vacuous quantification\",\n610\t            19,\n611\t            21,\n612\t            \"Medium (ISR detects 60%)\"\n613\t          ],\n614\t          [\n615\t            \"Premise redundancy\",\n616\t            14,\n617\t            15,\n618\t            \"High (ISR detects 90%)\"\n619\t          ],\n620\t          [\n621\t            \"Trivial conclusion\",\n622\t            8,\n623\t            7,\n624\t            \"Low (ISR detects 30%)\"\n625\t          ],\n626\t          [\n627\t            \"Correct structural\",\n628\t            26,\n629\t            30,\n630\t            \"N/A\"\n631\t          ],\n632\t          [\n633\t            \"Other degenerate\",\n634\t            5,\n635\t            5,\n636\t            \"Variable\"\n637\t          ]\n638\t        ]\n639\t      },\n640\t      {\n641\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: ISR detection sensitivity by hacking mode\",\n642\t        \"columns\": [\n643\t          \"hacking_mode\",\n644\t          \"n_samples\",\n645\t          \"isr_detects_%\",\n646\t          \"isr_misses_%\"\n647\t        ],\n648\t        \"rows\": [\n649\t          [\n650\t            \"Tautology injection\",\n651\t            56,\n652\t            85,\n653\t            15\n654\t          ],\n655\t          [\n656\t            \"Vacuous quantification\",\n657\t            38,\n658\t            60,\n659\t            40\n660\t          ],\n661\t          [\n662\t            \"Premise redundancy\",\n663\t            28,\n664\t            90,\n665\t            10\n666\t          ],\n667\t          [\n668\t            \"Trivial conclusion\",\n669\t            16,\n670\t            30,\n671\t            70\n672\t          ]\n673\t        ]\n674\t      }\n675\t    ],\n676\t    \"figures\": [],\n677\t    \"analysis\": \"Hacking taxonomy 是整篇 worst-档论文最有价值的贡献。它提供了三层 insight： (1) GRPO formalization training 产生的 reward hacking 不是单一模式，而是至少 4 种 distinct structural degeneracy patterns，各有不同的 ISR detection sensitivity； (2) STA-as-diagnostic 能检测大部分 hacking（overall sensitivity ~70%），但对 \\\"trivial conclusion\\\" 类 hacking 敏感度低——因为 conclusion 的 triviality 不一定体现为 component removability； (3) STA reward 的失败不是因为 ISR 无法 detect hacking，而是因为 detection signal 无法通过 GRPO gradient 有效传播（sparsity + variance 问题）。 这为 pivot narrative 提供了 closing argument：\\\"STA detects hacking effectively (diagnostic tool) but cannot prevent it via reward (training signal) in the current low-prove-rate regime.\\\"\\n\\n200-sample annotation 是 worst 档 narrative 的主要 empirical 贡献。在 STA-as-reward 失败后， hacking taxonomy 成为 STA-as-diagnostic 的 showcase。关键发现： (1) Tautology injection 是最常见的 hacking mode（28%），但 O(1) tautology check 仅覆盖 其中最显式的子类（literal P ∨ ¬P），大部分 tautologies 需要 full ablation 才能检测； (2) exec-only 和 exec+STA 的 hacking pattern 分布几乎相同（χ² test p=0.68）， 说明 STA reward 未选择性抑制任何特定 hacking mode——它只是均匀地压制了 prove_rate； (3) \\\"correct_structural\\\" 占比在两组中相似（26% vs 30%），但因 exec+STA 的 prove_rate 更低， 绝对数量远少； (4) Inter-annotator κ=0.72（substantial agreement），taxonomy 具有可复现性。\\n\"\n678\t  }\n679\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c3b8d53-bad7-4388-a83b-ef028fa0e75a","uuid":"636edc03-4664-498f-8c87-c7ca36d91504","timestamp":"2026-05-13T22:22:25.459Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T215750/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"FOL exec-only baseline (500 steps, 3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"FOL single-logic GRPO，仅用 execution reward (prove/fail binary)，K=8，500 steps，3 seeds。 作为 STA 对比的 baseline。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"prove_rate_overall_mean\": 0.24,\n      \"prove_rate_overall_std\": 0.03,\n      \"prove_rate_first100_mean\": 0.15,\n      \"prove_rate_last100_mean\": 0.28,\n      \"mean_isr_overall\": 0.11,\n      \"mean_isr_last100\": 0.08,\n      \"isr_pr_ratio_first100\": 0.82,\n      \"isr_pr_ratio_last100\": 0.29,\n      \"reward_mean_last100\": 0.28,\n      \"training_minutes_per_seed\": 78,\n      \"step_time_s\": 9.4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Exec-only training dynamics (3-seed average)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"step_range\",\n          \"prove_rate\",\n          \"mean_isr\",\n          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n          \"reward_mean\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0-100\",\n            0.15,\n            0.14,\n            0.82,\n            0.15\n          ],\n          [\n            \"100-200\",\n            0.19,\n            0.12,\n            0.55,\n            0.19\n          ],\n          [\n            \"200-300\",\n            0.22,\n            0.1,\n            0.41,\n            0.22\n          ],\n          [\n            \"300-400\",\n            0.25,\n            0.09,\n            0.33,\n            0.25\n          ],\n          [\n            \"400-500\",\n            0.28,\n            0.08,\n            0.29,\n            0.28\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Exec-only baseline 展现了 reward hacking 的教科书式 trajectory。prove_rate 的持续上升掩盖了 structural quality 的同步恶化。到 500 步时，约 71% 的 proved outputs 是 structurally degenerate (ISR/PR=0.29)。这为 STA 的 diagnostic 价值提供了 ground truth：如果没有 ISR metric， 仅看 prove_rate 会误判训练效果。\\n\\n\\n从 r5 数据外推：100 步时 prove_rate=0.15，last20=0.20，ISR/PR=1.0。500 步训练中， prove_rate 因 GRPO 的 on-policy exploration 持续上升至 ~0.28（符合 worst 区间 [0.18,0.3] 上段）， 但这种上升主要来自模型学会了 structural shortcuts（tautology injection, vacuous quantification, trivially true premises）。ISR/PR ratio 从初始 ~0.82 急剧下降至 ~0.29，反映了 structural degeneracy 的累积——模型越来越多地通过 degenerate proofs 获得 execution reward。这是经典的 reward hacking trajectory：accuracy 上升但 structural quality 同步恶化。3 seeds 间 variance 较小（std=0.03）， 说明这不是随机波动而是训练动力学的系统性特征。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"FOL exec+STA reward (500 steps, 3 seeds)\",\n    \"description\": \"FOL single-logic GRPO，execution + full STA reward (α=0.5, β=0.5)，K=8，500 steps，3 seeds。 Primary STA validation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"prove_rate_overall_mean\": 0.11,\n      \"prove_rate_overall_std\": 0.02,\n      \"prove_rate_first100_mean\": 0.09,\n      \"prove_rate_last100_mean\": 0.13,\n      \"mean_isr_overall\": 0.042,\n      \"mean_isr_last100\": 0.038,\n      \"isr_pr_ratio_first100\": 0.41,\n      \"isr_pr_ratio_last100\": 0.27,\n      \"reward_mean_last100\": 0.084,\n      \"training_minutes_per_seed\": 84,\n      \"step_time_s\": 10.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Exec+STA training dynamics (3-seed average)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"step_range\",\n          \"prove_rate\",\n          \"mean_isr\",\n          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n          \"reward_mean\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0-100\",\n            0.09,\n            0.052,\n            0.41,\n            0.071\n          ],\n          [\n            \"100-200\",\n            0.1,\n            0.047,\n            0.38,\n            0.074\n          ],\n          [\n            \"200-300\",\n            0.11,\n            0.044,\n            0.34,\n            0.077\n          ],\n          [\n            \"300-400\",\n            0.12,\n            0.041,\n            0.3,\n            0.081\n          ],\n          [\n            \"400-500\",\n            0.13,\n            0.038,\n            0.27,\n            0.084\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"STA reward 在 worst 档下表现为 net negative signal。prove_rate 的 gap（0.28 vs 0.13 at step 500） 具有统计显著性（p<0.01, 3 seeds），明确说明 STA reward hurts accuracy。ISR/PR ratio 两组均收敛至 相似低值（0.29 vs 0.27），说明 STA 也未能阻止 structural degeneracy。 关键 insight：在 prove_rate < 20% 的 sparse-signal regime 下，添加任何 secondary reward 都会因 gradient variance amplification 损害 primary objective。这本身是一个有价值的 negative result。\\n\\n\\n从 r5 数据外推：100 步时 prove_rate=0.10，ISR/PR=0.33（已低于 exec-only 的 1.0）。 在 worst 档下，STA reward 的加入不仅未提升 structural quality，反而通过两个机制损害了训练： (1) Low prove_rate regime 下 ISR 信号极度稀疏——只有 ~10% 的 samples 能 prove，其中仅 ~30% 有非零 ISR，导致 STA reward gradient 方差极大； (2) STA penalty 对 degenerate proofs 的惩罚使模型学会了回避 provable formulations， 转向 unprovable-but-syntactically-valid 的 outputs（\\\"reward avoidance\\\" 而非 \\\"reward seeking\\\"）。 结果是 prove_rate 被压制在 0.13 以下（远低于 exec-only 的 0.28），同时 ISR/PR ratio 仍继续下降 （0.41→0.27），说明即使 STA 惩罚了 degenerate proofs，少数仍 provable 的 outputs 中 structural quality 并未改善。Worst 档的核心表现：STA reward 同时降低了 accuracy 和 structural quality。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Held-out evaluation (plan_001 vs plan_002)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 test set 上对 plan_001 和 plan_002 的 best checkpoint 进行统一 full STA evaluation， 包括 prove_rate, ISR, ISR/PR ratio, hacking taxonomy annotation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"exec_only_held_out_prove_rate\": 0.22,\n      \"exec_only_held_out_isr_mean\": 0.058,\n      \"exec_only_held_out_isr_pr_ratio\": 0.26,\n      \"exec_sta_held_out_prove_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"exec_sta_held_out_isr_mean\": 0.035,\n      \"exec_sta_held_out_isr_pr_ratio\": 0.3,\n      \"exec_only_hacking_rate\": 0.74,\n      \"exec_sta_hacking_rate\": 0.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Held-out evaluation summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"condition\",\n          \"prove_rate\",\n          \"mean_isr\",\n          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n          \"hacking_rate\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"exec-only (best ckpt)\",\n            0.22,\n            0.058,\n            0.26,\n            0.74\n          ],\n          [\n            \"exec+STA (best ckpt)\",\n            0.1,\n            0.035,\n            0.3,\n            0.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"base model (no training)\",\n            0.12,\n            0.064,\n            0.53,\n            0.47\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Striking 发现：base model 的 ISR/PR ratio (0.53) 远高于两个训练后模型（0.26, 0.30）。 这说明 GRPO training 本身——无论是否加入 STA reward——都导致了 structural degeneracy。 STA reward 未能逆转这一趋势。但这个对比本身是 pivot narrative 的核心 empirical evidence： STA as diagnostic 能够量化 training-induced structural degradation，即使它无法作为 reward signal 阻止之。\\n\\n\\nHeld-out 表现与 training 趋势一致但 prove_rate 略低（distribution shift）。两组 held-out ISR 均落入 worst 区间 [0.03, 0.08]。关键发现：exec-only 虽然 prove_rate 高得多（0.22 vs 0.10）， 但 hacking_rate 极高（74%），说明其 accuracy 增益几乎全部来自 degenerate proofs。 exec+STA 的 hacking_rate 略低（70%），但考虑到其 prove_rate 仅为 0.10， 这个微小差异没有统计意义。ISR/PR ratio 在 held-out 上 exec+STA（0.30）甚至略高于 exec-only（0.26）， 但两者均在 worst 区间 [0.15-0.35] 内，差异不显著。结论：STA reward 对 held-out generalization 没有提供任何结构性改善。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"O(1) vs O(N) ablation (500 steps)\",\n    \"description\": \"用 fast_isr_fol (O(1) tautology-only check) 替代 full STA，500 steps，1 seed， 确认 O(1) 近似在长训练中同样无效。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"prove_rate_500step\": 0.23,\n      \"mean_isr_o1\": 0.006,\n      \"isr_pr_ratio_o1\": 0.03,\n      \"reward_mean_last100\": 0.23,\n      \"isr_discriminability\": 0.02\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: O(1) vs O(N) comparison at step 500\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"condition\",\n          \"prove_rate\",\n          \"mean_isr\",\n          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n          \"isr_discriminability\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"exec-only\",\n            0.24,\n            0.11,\n            0.29,\n            \"N/A\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"exec+STA O(N)\",\n            0.11,\n            0.042,\n            0.27,\n            0.31\n          ],\n          [\n            \"exec+STA O(1)\",\n            0.23,\n            0.006,\n            0.03,\n            0.02\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"O(1) 结果强化了 plan_002 的 negative finding：不是 STA 的粒度太粗导致 O(N) 失败， 而是在 low-prove-rate regime 下任何 ISR-based reward 都无法提供有效信号。 O(1) 的 near-zero discriminability 是一个 clean negative result，适合写入论文作为 \\\"ablation granularity matters for diagnostic but not for training\\\" 的 evidence。\\n\\n\\nO(1) (tautology-only check) 几乎退化为 exec-only：fast_isr_fol 仅检测最粗粒度的 tautology （如 P ∨ ¬P），而 GRPO 训练产生的 degenerate proofs 类型远更精细（vacuous quantification, premise redundancy, trivially satisfiable structures）。这些 subtler hacking modes 完全绕过 tautology check，导致 O(1) ISR ≈ 0 对绝大多数 samples。prove_rate 与 exec-only 基本一致 （0.23 vs 0.24），证明 O(1) ISR signal 没有对训练产生任何影响——它既不提供有用的 gradient 信号（太稀疏），也不消耗足够计算资源来产生隐式正则化效应。ISR discriminability 仅 0.02， 远低于 full STA 的 ~0.3，确认 O(1) 近似无法区分 structural quality levels。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"STA reward weight ablation (α/β ratios + curriculum)\",\n    \"description\": \"测试 α/β = {0.3/0.7, 0.5/0.5, 0.7/0.3} + sigmoid curriculum vs fixed， 共 6 configurations，各 200 steps，1 seed。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"configs\": [\n        {\n          \"config\": \"α=0.3 β=0.7 fixed\",\n          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.18,\n          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.35,\n          \"reward_mean\": 0.19\n        },\n        {\n          \"config\": \"α=0.5 β=0.5 fixed\",\n          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.13,\n          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.3,\n          \"reward_mean\": 0.09\n        },\n        {\n          \"config\": \"α=0.7 β=0.3 fixed\",\n          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.07,\n          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.38,\n          \"reward_mean\": 0.05\n        },\n        {\n          \"config\": \"α=0.3 β=0.7 sigmoid\",\n          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.19,\n          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.33,\n          \"reward_mean\": 0.2\n        },\n        {\n          \"config\": \"α=0.5 β=0.5 sigmoid\",\n          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.15,\n          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.29,\n          \"reward_mean\": 0.1\n        },\n        {\n          \"config\": \"α=0.7 β=0.3 sigmoid\",\n          \"prove_rate_200\": 0.09,\n          \"isr_pr_ratio_200\": 0.35,\n          \"reward_mean\": 0.06\n        }\n      ],\n      \"best_prove_rate_config\": \"α=0.3 β=0.7 sigmoid\",\n      \"best_isr_pr_config\": \"α=0.7 β=0.3 fixed\",\n      \"stable_operating_point\": null\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Weight ablation results at step 200\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"α\",\n          \"β\",\n          \"schedule\",\n          \"prove_rate\",\n          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n          \"reward_mean\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0.3,\n            0.7,\n            \"fixed\",\n            0.18,\n            0.35,\n            0.19\n          ],\n          [\n            0.5,\n            0.5,\n            \"fixed\",\n            0.13,\n            0.3,\n            0.09\n          ],\n          [\n            0.7,\n            0.3,\n            \"fixed\",\n            0.07,\n            0.38,\n            0.05\n          ],\n          [\n            0.3,\n            0.7,\n            \"sigmoid\",\n            0.19,\n            0.33,\n            0.2\n          ],\n          [\n            0.5,\n            0.5,\n            \"sigmoid\",\n            0.15,\n            0.29,\n            0.1\n          ],\n          [\n            0.7,\n            0.3,\n            \"sigmoid\",\n            0.09,\n            0.35,\n            0.06\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"6 个 configurations 均位于 exec-only baseline 的 Pareto frontier 之下或之上但仅在一个维度。 没有任何设置同时改善 prove_rate 和 ISR/PR ratio。这是 worst 档的 definitive evidence： STA reward 在当前 prove_rate regime 下没有 viable operating point。 写入论文时应 frame 为：\\\"STA reward 的有效性受限于 base prove_rate——当 solver success rate < 20% 时， ISR 的 per-step 有效 sample size 不足以支撑稳定的 policy gradient 估计。这为未来工作指出了 clear prerequisite：STA-as-reward 需要更强的 base solver 或 curriculum-based prove_rate bootstrapping。\\\"\\n\\n\\nWorst 档核心假设：no stable operating point exists。具体表现为 prove_rate 和 ISR/PR ratio 之间存在不可调和的 Pareto trade-off： - 低 β（STA 权重小）：prove_rate 接近 exec-only 但 ISR/PR 无改善（STA 信号被淹没） - 高 β（STA 权重大）：ISR/PR ratio 略有改善但 prove_rate 被严重压制（0.07-0.09） - Sigmoid curriculum 略优于 fixed（early 阶段 STA 权重低允许 prove_rate 建立），\\n  但 200 步时差异不显著（0.19 vs 0.18）\\n根本原因是 ISR signal 的 sparsity：只有 proved samples 才有非零 ISR，而 prove_rate < 20% 意味着 STA reward 的有效 batch size 约为 K × prove_rate ≈ 1.6 samples/step。这个 sample efficiency 太低，无法在任何 α/β 设置下提供稳定的 training signal。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Prolog single-logic GRPO (exec-only vs exec+STA)\",\n    \"description\": \"Prolog STA instantiation + single-logic GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 steps，K=8，1 seed。 Second logic type validation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"prolog_sta_instantiation_success\": false,\n      \"prolog_solver_timeout_rate\": 0.65,\n      \"prolog_prove_rate_exec_only\": 0.03,\n      \"prolog_prove_rate_exec_sta\": 0.01,\n      \"prolog_isr_discriminability\": 0.04,\n      \"prolog_mean_isr\": 0.008,\n      \"prolog_training_completed\": false,\n      \"failure_mode\": \"solver_timeout_and_trivial_isr\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Prolog STA instantiation diagnostics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SWI-Prolog timeout rate (10s)\",\n            \"65%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean clauses per program\",\n            2.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ISR binary rate (0 or 1)\",\n            \"89%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ISR discriminability\",\n            0.04\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Prove rate (base model)\",\n            0.03\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Training terminated early\",\n            \"yes (step ~300)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Prolog 实例化的失败并非 STA 方法论的失败，而是 infrastructure 层面的问题： (1) SWI-Prolog 的 timeout 行为使 O(N) ablation 在合理时间内不可行； (2) 基座模型的 Prolog 生成能力太弱（prove_rate 0.03），GRPO 缺乏 bootstrap signal。 论文中应诚实报告这些 failure modes，并 frame 为 STA derivation protocol 第 1 步（pilot study） 的 go/no-go 信号——Prolog 在当前 setup 下是 \\\"no-go\\\"，这本身验证了 protocol 的 gatekeeping 功能。\\n\\n\\nProlog STA 实例化在 worst 档下失败，原因链： (1) SWI-Prolog rule ablation 需要逐条删除 clause 并重新 query——对每个 N-clause 程序需 N 次 solver call，而 SWI-Prolog 在复杂递归程序上 timeout 率高（65% samples 超过 10s timeout）； (2) 成功执行的 samples 中，大部分 Prolog 程序结构简单（2-3 clauses），ISR 退化为 binary (0 或 1)，discriminability 仅 0.04——无法区分 structural quality levels； (3) prove_rate 极低（0.03），因为 LLM 生成的 Prolog 大多无法通过 SWI-Prolog 的 strict syntax check（缺少 dot terminator, 变量命名错误, 递归无 base case 等）。 在这种条件下 GRPO 训练几乎没有可用的 reward signal，500 步后 prove_rate 无显著变化。 exec+STA 条件更差（0.01），因为少量 proved samples 中 ISR penalty 进一步压制了 reward。 训练在 ~300 步后因 KL divergence explosion 被提前终止。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog)\",\n    \"description\": \"FOL+Prolog mixed training，exec-only vs exec+STA，500 steps，K=8，1 seed。 Cross-logic transfer test。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"not_run\",\n      \"reason\": \"blocked by plan_006 failure — Prolog prove_rate too low for meaningful multi-logic training\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Plan_007 未执行是 worst 档的直接后果。论文叙事中这意味着 Claim 2 (multi-logic) 无法验证， paper 退化为 single-logic (FOL-only)。叙事 pivot 将 multi-logic 从 core claim 降级为 future work，Claim 2 重新定义为 \\\"single-logic deep analysis of reward hacking patterns\\\"。\\n\\n\\nplan_006 的 Prolog prove_rate (0.03) 使得 mixed training 中 Prolog samples 几乎不贡献 任何 reward signal。如果强行运行，mixed batch 中 Prolog samples 会稀释 FOL 的有效 gradient， 导致 FOL prove_rate 也下降。鉴于 plan_006 已明确 Prolog 不可用，plan_007 被标记为 not_run 以节省 GPU budget。论文中应说明 blocked dependency 并将此作为 limitation 讨论。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"FOL-trained model 在 Prolog tasks 上的 zero-shot evaluation，反之亦然。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"fol_to_prolog_prove_rate\": 0.02,\n      \"fol_to_prolog_delta_vs_base\": -0.01,\n      \"prolog_to_fol_prove_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"prolog_to_fol_delta_vs_base\": -0.02,\n      \"cross_logic_transfer_delta_mean\": -0.015\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Cross-logic transfer matrix\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"train_logic\",\n          \"eval_logic\",\n          \"prove_rate\",\n          \"delta_vs_base\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"FOL\",\n            \"FOL\",\n            0.24,\n            \"+0.12\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FOL\",\n            \"Prolog\",\n            0.02,\n            \"-0.01\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Prolog\",\n            \"FOL\",\n            0.1,\n            \"-0.02\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Prolog\",\n            \"Prolog\",\n            0.03,\n            \"±0.00\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"base\",\n            \"FOL\",\n            0.12,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"base\",\n            \"Prolog\",\n            0.03,\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Transfer matrix 的 off-diagonal 元素均 ≤ base model，排除了 positive transfer 的可能。 这在 worst 档下是 expected 的：FOL 和 Prolog 的 syntax、reasoning patterns、solver interface 差异太大，100-step scale 的 GRPO 训练不足以学到 transferable logical reasoning abilities。 论文中应将此作为 \\\"the GRPO signal is task-specific, not reasoning-general\\\" 的 evidence。\\n\\n\\nCross-logic transfer 在 worst 档下表现为 near-zero 或 slightly negative。 FOL→Prolog：基座模型 Prolog prove_rate 仅 0.03，FOL-trained 模型进一步下降至 0.02 （negative transfer，FOL 训练强化的 quantifier-heavy 生成模式不适用于 Prolog 的 clause-based 结构）。 Prolog→FOL：由于 plan_006 训练提前终止，Prolog-trained model 几乎等同于 base model， FOL prove_rate 为 0.10（略低于 base model 的 0.12，noise range 内）。 transfer_delta 均值 -0.015 落入 worst 区间 [-0.05, 0.01]。 结论：当前 setup 下不存在有意义的 cross-logic transfer，两种逻辑类型的 formalization patterns 在 representation space 中不共享可迁移的 substructures。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SFT baseline comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"Supervised finetuning on FOLIO 500 samples (gold FOL translations)，作为 GRPO 的 non-RL baseline。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sft_prove_rate\": 0.3,\n      \"sft_mean_isr\": 0.15,\n      \"sft_isr_pr_ratio\": 0.5,\n      \"sft_hacking_rate\": 0.5,\n      \"sft_training_minutes\": 12,\n      \"sft_held_out_prove_rate\": 0.25,\n      \"sft_held_out_isr_mean\": 0.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: SFT vs GRPO comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"prove_rate\",\n          \"mean_isr\",\n          \"isr_pr_ratio\",\n          \"hacking_rate\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SFT\",\n            0.3,\n            0.15,\n            0.5,\n            0.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GRPO exec-only\",\n            0.24,\n            0.08,\n            0.29,\n            0.74\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GRPO exec+STA\",\n            0.11,\n            0.038,\n            0.27,\n            0.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"base model\",\n            0.12,\n            0.064,\n            0.53,\n            0.47\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SFT baseline 是 worst 档 narrative 的关键支柱。它揭示了一个 hierarchy： SFT > exec-only GRPO > exec+STA GRPO（在 structural quality 上） SFT ≈ exec-only GRPO > exec+STA GRPO > base（在 accuracy 上） 这强化了 pivot narrative：GRPO+STA 不仅未解决 hacking，在每个维度上都是最差的。 但 SFT 的 limitation 是需要 gold data——这为 future work 留下了空间。\\n\\n\\nSFT 直接从 gold translations 学习，不受 reward signal sparsity 限制。prove_rate (0.30) 略高于 exec-only GRPO (0.24)，因为 SFT 的 supervised signal 更稳定。关键差异在 structural quality：SFT 的 ISR/PR ratio (0.50) 远高于两个 GRPO 条件（0.29 和 0.27），因为 SFT 模仿的是 gold translations 而非 solver-exploitable patterns。SFT 的 hacking_rate (0.50) 约为 exec-only GRPO (0.74) 的 2/3——说明 GRPO 的 on-policy exploration 特别容易发现并 exploit solver shortcuts。 这为 worst 档叙事提供了重要对比：不仅 STA reward 无效，exec-only GRPO 本身相对于 SFT 也引入了 额外的 structural degeneracy。论文可以 argue \\\"GRPO without adequate structural reward is actively worse than SFT for structural quality, despite similar or higher execution accuracy\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO\",\n    \"description\": \"SMT-LIB STA instantiation + single-logic GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA。Third logic type。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"not_run\",\n      \"reason\": \"P2 priority, dropped after Prolog failure — budget redirected to plan_009 and plan_012\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"合理的 triage 决策。论文中将 SMT-LIB 和 Prolog 均列为 future work， 并强调 STA derivation protocol 的 solver-agnostic 设计使得扩展是 straightforward 的 （given adequate solver performance and base model capability）。\\n\\n\\n在 Prolog 实例化失败后，继续尝试第三种逻辑类型的 ROI 太低。SMT-LIB (Z3) 面临与 Prolog 类似的 timeout 风险（constraint ablation 需要逐个删除 assert 并重新 check-sat）， 且基座模型的 SMT-LIB 生成能力未经验证。GPU budget 重新分配给更有确定性的 plan_009 (SFT baseline) 和 plan_012 (hacking characterization)，后者不需要 GPU 但需要大量人工标注时间。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B scaling experiment\",\n    \"description\": \"在 8B model 上运行 full MLSR pipeline (1 seed)，测试 model scale effect。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"not_run\",\n      \"reason\": \"P2 priority, blocked by plan_005 showing no stable operating point — scaling a broken reward signal is pointless\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Correct decision。如果有额外 budget，应优先运行 8B exec-only（验证 scale 对 base prove_rate 的影响），而非 8B exec+STA。论文中可以将此作为 future work： \\\"STA-as-reward may become viable at higher base prove_rates achievable with larger models.\\\"\\n\\n\\nplan_005 已证明 STA reward 在当前架构下没有 viable operating point。在 8B model 上重复 失败的 reward design 不会改变根本问题（ISR signal sparsity）。虽然 8B model 可能有更高的 base prove_rate（缓解 sparsity），但这是一个 confound 而非 clean ablation。 Budget 不足以同时运行 8B exec-only baseline，无法区分 \\\"scale helps\\\" vs \\\"scale + STA helps\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Hacking characterization (200-sample annotation)\",\n    \"description\": \"对 plan_003 的 held-out outputs 进行 200-sample manual annotation， 按 extensional-shortcut taxonomy 分类 reward hacking patterns。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_annotated\": 200,\n      \"inter_annotator_agreement_kappa\": 0.72,\n      \"taxonomy_categories\": {\n        \"tautology_injection\": {\n          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.28,\n          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.22,\n          \"example\": \"adding P ∨ ¬P as premise to make any conclusion provable\"\n        },\n        \"vacuous_quantification\": {\n          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.19,\n          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.21,\n          \"example\": \"∀x(P(x) → Q(x)) where P is never instantiated\"\n        },\n        \"premise_redundancy\": {\n          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.14,\n          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.15,\n          \"example\": \"repeating premises in different syntactic forms\"\n        },\n        \"trivial_conclusion\": {\n          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.08,\n          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.07,\n          \"example\": \"concluding with a tautology regardless of premises\"\n        },\n        \"correct_structural\": {\n          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.26,\n          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.3,\n          \"example\": \"genuinely reflects NL semantics\"\n        },\n        \"other_degenerate\": {\n          \"exec_only_rate\": 0.05,\n          \"exec_sta_rate\": 0.05,\n          \"example\": \"miscellaneous patterns not fitting above categories\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"key_finding\": \"Hacking pattern distributions are nearly identical between exec-only and exec+STA, confirming STA reward did not selectively suppress any hacking mode.\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Hacking taxonomy distribution (200 samples per condition)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"category\",\n          \"exec_only_%\",\n          \"exec_sta_%\",\n          \"ISR_sensitivity\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Tautology injection\",\n            28,\n            22,\n            \"High (ISR detects 85%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Vacuous quantification\",\n            19,\n            21,\n            \"Medium (ISR detects 60%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Premise redundancy\",\n            14,\n            15,\n            \"High (ISR detects 90%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trivial conclusion\",\n            8,\n            7,\n            \"Low (ISR detects 30%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Correct structural\",\n            26,\n            30,\n            \"N/A\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Other degenerate\",\n            5,\n            5,\n            \"Variable\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: ISR detection sensitivity by hacking mode\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"hacking_mode\",\n          \"n_samples\",\n          \"isr_detects_%\",\n          \"isr_misses_%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Tautology injection\",\n            56,\n            85,\n            15\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Vacuous quantification\",\n            38,\n            60,\n            40\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Premise redundancy\",\n            28,\n            90,\n            10\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trivial conclusion\",\n            16,\n            30,\n            70\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Hacking taxonomy 是整篇 worst-档论文最有价值的贡献。它提供了三层 insight： (1) GRPO formalization training 产生的 reward hacking 不是单一模式，而是至少 4 种 distinct structural degeneracy patterns，各有不同的 ISR detection sensitivity； (2) STA-as-diagnostic 能检测大部分 hacking（overall sensitivity ~70%），但对 \\\"trivial conclusion\\\" 类 hacking 敏感度低——因为 conclusion 的 triviality 不一定体现为 component removability； (3) STA reward 的失败不是因为 ISR 无法 detect hacking，而是因为 detection signal 无法通过 GRPO gradient 有效传播（sparsity + variance 问题）。 这为 pivot narrative 提供了 closing argument：\\\"STA detects hacking effectively (diagnostic tool) but cannot prevent it via reward (training signal) in the current low-prove-rate regime.\\\"\\n\\n200-sample annotation 是 worst 档 narrative 的主要 empirical 贡献。在 STA-as-reward 失败后， hacking taxonomy 成为 STA-as-diagnostic 的 showcase。关键发现： (1) Tautology injection 是最常见的 hacking mode（28%），但 O(1) tautology check 仅覆盖 其中最显式的子类（literal P ∨ ¬P），大部分 tautologies 需要 full ablation 才能检测； (2) exec-only 和 exec+STA 的 hacking pattern 分布几乎相同（χ² test p=0.68）， 说明 STA reward 未选择性抑制任何特定 hacking mode——它只是均匀地压制了 prove_rate； (3) \\\"correct_structural\\\" 占比在两组中相似（26% vs 30%），但因 exec+STA 的 prove_rate 更低， 绝对数量远少； (4) Inter-annotator κ=0.72（substantial agreement），taxonomy 具有可复现性。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":679,"startLine":1,"totalLines":679}}}
